    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in eBusiness"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Minor in eBusiness prepares students to work in careers in the evolving Internet economy and the world of electronic commerce. It provides students, who have already developed a solid understanding of business principles and operations with in-depth knowledge of the specifics of setting up and operating a 'virtual' business, either stand alone or as part of an existing conventional organization."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Minor is co-ordinated by the Ted Rogers School of Information Technology Management; however, courses in the Minor are delivered by Schools and departments across the Ted Rogers School of Management."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: Ted Rogers School of Information Technology Management"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Required courses (2):"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "ITM 550 Advanced e-Business",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "ITM 550",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/information-technology-management/ITM/550/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "RMG 910 Omni-Channel Retailing or RMG 300 Retail Information Systems",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "RMG 910",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/retail-management/RMG/910/"
        },
        {
          "text": "RMG 300",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/retail-management/RMG/300/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus four (4) of the following:"
    },
    {
